<!--
    kuna `crossjumprevert`, past one block (`ActionCrossJumpTail`, P8
    "goto-quality"): after `gotosink`, a goto to a shared run of statements is
    rewritten when flow after the run is known.  The run is copied after the
    jump when both paths reach the same place, the code after the jumping
    `if` becomes its else arm when that converges instead, and a run that
    ends the body of the jump's innermost loop is copied before a
    `continue;`.  Pass 1 is the default, pass 2 has `option crossjumprevert
    off`.  A switch case that jumps into a run ending another case that
    leaves the switch gets a copy of the run and leaves the switch too.

    The bytes are houdini_escape_href, S_normalize_code,
    cmark_strbuf_normalize_whitespace, cmark_strbuf_truncate,
    cmark_node_own and parse_inline (with its case table) of swift-cmark 0.29.0.gfm.13 (BSD-2-Clause), built by
    clang for arm64-apple-ios at -O2 -fno-inline.
-->
